419	instagram_section	{"body": "Follow along for real celebrations, styling ideas, and behind-the-scenes moments from the events we love creating. A little inspiration, a little planning help, and a lot of beautiful details.", "heading": "Behind the Scenes", "cta_label": "Join the instagram fam!"}	\N
420	vendor_partner	{"body": "Great events are never created alone. We work with a trusted circle of florists, decorators, caterers, bartenders, and production houses who help bring celebrations to life. If you'd like to be part of our vendor network, we'd love to hear from you.", "heading": "Partner with Elewen", "cta_label": "Apply as a Vendor"}	\N
335	consultation_cta	{"body": "Drop your details, and we'll get in touch. You're just one call away from turning the confusion into a clear, sorted plan.", "cta_url": "/consultation", "heading": "Confused, Excited or somewhere in between?", "cta_label": "Book a Consultation"}	\N
326	checklist	{"tagline": "11 takes the chaos out so you can stay in the moment", "heading_1": "Somewhere along the way,", "heading_2": "Hosting turned into checklists.", "chaos_items": [{"body": "What was once simple now means endless scrolling and still no confidence.", "title": "Too much scrolling."}, {"body": "Follow-ups, confirmations, negotiations, and last-minute checks, your phone turns into a coordination hub, and excitement becomes stress.", "title": "Too many calls."}, {"body": "One decorator, one caterer, one supplier, different prices, different chaos. You're not planning a celebration; you're managing a team.", "title": "Too many vendors."}, {"body": "Color themes, backdrops, menus, endless add-ons, more options don't mean more freedom, just more pressure.", "title": "Too many decisions."}], "relief_items": ["You don't have to manage people.", "You don't have to manage logistics", "No chasing vendors.", "No waiting anxiously."], "relief_heading": "Stop take a deep breath"}	\N
341	better_way	{"body": "Event planners can feel expensive and overwhelming. Doing everything yourself can quickly become stressful. Elewen brings the best of both, thoughtful styling without the chaos.", "heading_1": "A Better Way Between", "heading_2": "Event and DIY", "left_label": "Event Planner", "right_label": "DIY", "left_description": "Full-service planning often comes with high costs and long coordination cycles. You rely on large teams, multiple approvals, and a process that can feel heavier than the event itself.", "right_description": "Planning everything yourself means juggling vendors, comparing prices, managing logistics, and making countless decisions. It quickly turns a celebration into a checklist.", "center_description": "The balance between structure and simplicity. You get curated decor, trusted vendors, and guided planning, without the pressure or the price of full-scale event management."}	\N
342	packages_intro	{"body": "Celebrations became louder and bigger, but less personal. Elewen exists to bring that feeling back, not through more, but through meaning.", "heading_1": "Somewhere Between Moodboards", "heading_2": "and Reality, the Feeling Got Lost.", "section_heading": "Our Most Loved Packages"}	\N
345	testimonials_intro	{"heading": "Real Celebrations. Real Experiences."}	\N
346	instagram_section	{"body": "Follow along for real celebrations, styling ideas, and behind-the-scenes moments from the events we love creating. A little inspiration, a little planning help, and a lot of beautiful details.", "heading": "Behind the Scenes", "cta_label": "Join the instagram fam!"}	\N
347	vendor_partner	{"body": "Great events are never created alone. We work with a trusted circle of florists, decorators, caterers, bartenders, and production houses who help bring celebrations to life. If you'd like to be part of our vendor network, we'd love to hear from you.", "heading": "Partner with Elewen", "cta_label": "Apply as a Vendor"}	\N
343	planner_cta	{"body": "Want a professional to handle your event end to end? Fill the form and let our in-house planners plan it with you.", "cta_url": "/in-house-planner", "cta_label": "Plan with Elewen", "heading_1": "Every celebration deserves its own feeling.", "heading_2": "Not another generic template"}	\N
