360	story_opening	{"heading_1": "When we saw Excitement", "heading_2": "Turning Into Overthinking", "paragraphs": ["Elewen was born from noticing a simple truth: many people love the idea of hosting, but hesitate because planning an event often feels like too much to manage.", "Finding reliable vendors, understanding fair pricing, and coordinating everything usually means relying on social media, referrals, and endless back-and-forth."]}	\N
361	celebrations_matter	{"heading": "Celebrations Don't Have to Be Big to Matter", "paragraphs": ["Hosting a party, celebrating with close friends and family, and taking a pause from everyday life truly matters.", "Elewen exists to protect that feeling. We focus on the little details and personal touches that turn simple gatherings into meaningful moments."]}	\N
369	celebrations_matter	{"heading": "Celebrations Don't Have to Be Big to Matter", "paragraphs": ["Hosting a party, celebrating with close friends and family, and taking a pause from everyday life truly matters.", "Elewen exists to protect that feeling. We focus on the little details and personal touches that turn simple gatherings into meaningful moments."]}	\N
370	simple_question	{"body": "Almost everything else in our lives has moved online. We book cabs and holidays in minutes, so why does event planning still feel complicated?", "heading": "We Asked a Simple Question"}	\N
