378	what_we_do	{"intro": "This option is for you if you want a professional handling everything end to end. From the first conversation to the final wrap-up, your planner handles it all.", "heading": "What we do as your In-House Planner", "bullet_points": ["Understanding your vision", "Concept & showflow planning", "Vendor management, coordination and production", "Styling and creative direction", "Timelines, approvals, and execution", "Being present so you don't have to worry"]}	\N
379	moksha_bio	{"intro": "Co-founder at Elewen and a professional event planner with 6+ years of industry experience. Trained in International Events in the UK, I bring structure, creativity, and calm to every celebration.", "greeting": "Hi, I'm Moksha.", "personal_note": "Some events call for personal attention and thoughtful detailing. They need intention, detail, and a planner who truly cares, that's exactly why the In-House Planner was created."}	\N
