389	FAQ Section	{"faqs": [{"answer": "Pricing depends on your event type, selected services, and chosen package. Every package displays a clear starting price, and any add-ons are shown before you confirm. No hidden charges.", "question": "How is pricing determined?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Depending on timelines and availability, our team can help you adjust services, decor elements, and package selections after your initial booking.", "question": "Can I customise a package after booking?"}, {"answer": "You can reach your assigned planner directly through your event dashboard, and our support team remains available for urgent coordination needs throughout the event.", "question": "How do I reach support during the event?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Elewen works with vetted vendor partners so quality, timing, and reliability are maintained across your celebration.", "question": "Are vendors pre-vetted by Elewen?"}, {"answer": "If a last-minute issue comes up, our team steps in immediately to coordinate an alternative from our vendor network and keep the event on track.", "question": "What happens if a vendor cancels last-minute?"}, {"answer": "Cancellation terms depend on the booking stage and vendor commitments. Your planner will walk you through the applicable policy before confirmation.", "question": "What is the cancellation policy?"}], "description": "Still unsure? Here are the answers to the most common questions.", "heading_line_1": "Everything You", "heading_line_2": "Need to Know."}	\N
